  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Vampiric Defense</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/73/Angel_Machine_Gun_Fire.gif/revision/latest?cb=20190331012246\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Angel Machine Gun Fire\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/73/Angel_Machine_Gun_Fire.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20190331012246\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/73/Angel_Machine_Gun_Fire.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20190331012246 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/73/Angel_Machine_Gun_Fire.gif/revision/latest?cb=20190331012246 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Angel Machine Gun Fire\" width=\"270\" height=\"147\" data-image-key=\"Angel_Machine_Gun_Fire.gif\" data-image-name=\"Angel Machine Gun Fire.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Angel (Buffy the Vampire Slayer/Angel) taking advantage of his vampire durability to take and survive machine gun fire.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Use vampiric power to defend oneself.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>use vampiric energy/power to defend oneself</b>. Technique of <a href=\"/wiki/Vampiric_Force_Manipulation\" title=\"Vampiric Force Manipulation\">Vampiric Force Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Undead_Defense\" title=\"Undead Defense\">Undead Defense</a>. Opposite to <a href=\"/wiki/Vampiric_Attacks\" title=\"Vampiric Attacks\">Vampiric Attacks</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Defense\" title=\"Absorption Defense\">Absorption Defense</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FVampiric_Defense%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user possesses defensive skills that are enhanced by vampiric energy/power, allowing them to block, parry, dodge, etc., with the power of vampires.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FVampiric_Defense%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Defense\">Enhanced Defense</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Exoskeleton\" title=\"Energy Exoskeleton\">Vampiric Exoskeleton</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Vampiric_Infusion\" title=\"Vampiric Infusion\">Vampiric Infusion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Shield_Construction\" title=\"Energy Shield Construction\">Vampiric Shield Construction</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Wall_Generation\" title=\"Energy Wall Generation\">Vampiric Wall Generation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FVampiric_Defense%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Undead_Defense\" title=\"Undead Defense\">Undead Defense</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Vampiric_Force_Manipulation\" title=\"Vampiric Force Manipulation\">Vampiric Force Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FVampiric_Defense%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May require outside source of vampiric energy/power to make defensive maneuvers.</li>\n<li>Users will be exhausted when too much energy is used.</li>\n<li>May be over-charged/wounded if too much energy is used at once.</li>\n<li>Can only be used for defensive purposes.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FVampiric_Defense%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Vampires (<i>Buffy the Vampire Slayer</i>)\n<ul><li>Angel</li>\n<li>Spike</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dgrayman.fandom.com/wiki/Arystar_Krory_III\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dgrayman:Arystar Krory III\">Arystar Krory III</a> (<i>D.Gray-man</i>)</li>\n<li>Alucard (<i>Hellsing</i>)</li>\n<li>Kain (<i>Legacy of Kain</i>)</li>\n<li>Jonathan Reid (<i>Vampyr</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://herokiller.fandom.com/wiki/Baek-Ji\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:herokiller:Baek-Ji\">Baek-Ji</a> (<i>Hero Killer</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FVampiric_Defense%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-ico